cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper it implements."
title: "obqac: a single-step optimisation-based kinematic controller for legged robots"
abstract: >-
  Python and CasADi implementation of a path-tracking controller for legged robots driven
  through their built-in gait controllers: one four-variable quadratic programme per sample
  instead of a receding horizon, with velocity and acceleration limits as constraints.
license: MIT
